text = "Little bunny has crash-landed on a strange planet after its UFO broke. 
To escape, collect at least 3 gears for each levels to repair the UFO and leave the planet!
In level 3, collect as much gears as you can! Good Luck~

Use the keyboard to move:
A = Move Left
D = Move Right
W = Jump

Health (Hearts)
- You start with 5 hearts.
- Getting too close to the BOSS or other creatures will damage the bunny and deduct hearts.
- If your hearts run out, you lose the level.

Healing Items
- Collect carrots during the level to restore hearts (recover hearts).




Winning the Level
- Explore the planet and collect at least 3 gears for each levels to help bunny to go back home."

